        "content": "<p>I was working on the space version of the Moore-Aronzajin theorem. In this I need to extend the domain of a linear isometry and preserve that is it a linear isometry. The isometry part I could find in <code>Isometry.completion_extension</code>. The linearity part I couldn't find. Does that exists?</p>\n<p>For when it doesn't exist, I have made a pull request at <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/40151\">#40151</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>MWE:</strong><br>\nThe map that I want to construct is added below. I replace a few bits with <code>sorry</code> to keep the MWE short. The question relates to the <code>h_lin</code> here. You can run it by pasting this on line 327 (end of OfKernel section) in the file <code>InnerProductSpace/Reproducing</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PosSemidef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">posSemidef_kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RKHSEquivOfKernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃ₗᵢ</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">OfKernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofH₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→ₗᵢ</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">linearCombination</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">xv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RKHS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kerFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">norm_map'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp_rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">norm_eq_sqrt_re_inner</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inner_H₀_def</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">linearCombination_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum_inner</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inner_sum</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inner_smul_left</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inner_smul_right</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kernel_inner</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_assoc</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_uni</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofH₀</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isometry</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">uniformContinuous</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_iso</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Isometry</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">completion_extension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofH₀</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isometry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_lin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLinearMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">UniformSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Completion</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofH₀</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofOfKernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">OfKernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→ₗᵢ</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">𝕜</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UniformSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Completion</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofH₀</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">map_add'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_lin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">map_smul'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_lin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map_smul</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">norm_map'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_iso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dist_eq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_lin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp_all</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h_surj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Surjective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ofOfKernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><sp